    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "一个看似专业的名字「K-means 聚类」，背后藏着怎样一个直观问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "信号量化和模式分析都需要为大量观测找到紧凑代表。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-least-squares-quantization-in-pcm"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "算法反复把每个点分配给最近质心，再把每个质心更新为该簇的均值。 关键机制是交替质心优化，它把资料线索与可见的演示行为连接起来。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-least-squares-quantization-in-pcm"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 k-means 视为简单但持久的无监督学习基线。它的长期影响在于“分配样本 + 更新中心”的循环仍是聚类、压缩、初始化、向量量化和探索性数据分析的核心。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-least-squares-quantization-in-pcm"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「K-means 聚类」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
